<div id="systemRequirements" class="modal fade" role="dialog">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-md">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h4 class="content-subheading">Virtual Hearing System Requirements</h4>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <p><strong>TO TAKE PART IN YOUR VIRTUAL HEARING, YOU MUST:</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Have a computer with a webcam, mobile device, or video conference system.</li>
                    <li>Have a reliable, high-speed Internet connection (at least 1 - 1.5 megabits/second).</li>
                    <li>Download the Cisco WebEx application prior to joining your Virtual Hearing,
                        <a href="https://www.webex.com/downloads.html" target="_blank">WebEx Download</a></li>
                    <li>Test your system by visiting WebEx
                        <a href="https://www.webex.com/test-meeting.html" target="_blank">test meeting</a>
                        at least 48 hours prior to your virtual hearing</li>
                    <li>Add the WebEx extension to your browser if prompted when using a computer.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
